  {
    "name": "WF3 Demand → Whop",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "### WF3 — Demand → offer\nPASS = replies ≥ max(25, ceil(views × 1%)).\n\nThe offer on PASS is the **three agent tiers, one Whop product each**:\nCircle **$44** · Pro **$53** · Team **$62**. The one-time ladder ($28 first shot,\n$17 Lite, $35 Good, $89 Better) is a separate door and never gates a tier.\n\n**Nothing is created in Whop by this workflow.** Whop product ids are set once by the\nowner and read by the app from env.",
          "height": 300,
          "width": 420,
          "color": 4
        },
        "id": "293a0bbd-d7dd-555c-b49b-b8c6c865aee6",
        "name": "README",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          -380,
          0
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "rule": {
            "interval": [
              {
                "field": "cronExpression",
                "expression": "0 9 * * *"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "id": "8443bb69-2e7f-5285-86fe-0e0b2cd279a2",
        "name": "09:00 daily",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
        "typeVersion": 1.1,
        "position": [
          0,
          0
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "operation": "executeQuery",
          "query": "SELECT id, platform, views, replies FROM post_analytics WHERE posted_at::date = CURRENT_DATE - 1 ORDER BY id",
          "options": {}
        },
        "id": "2d14538e-d29f-5e2d-8a4c-90600baaad23",
        "name": "Yesterday stats",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
        "typeVersion": 2.4,
        "position": [
          220,
          0
        ],
        "credentials": {
          "postgres": {
            "id": "REPLACE_POSTGRES",
            "name": "Neon (jarvis)"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "jsCode": "// The gate is arithmetic, not judgement. Same formula as lib/stickman-agent.ts.\nconst rows = $input.all().map(r => r.json);\nconst results = rows.map(r => {\n  const views = Number(r.views || 0);\n  const replies = Number(r.replies || 0);\n  const bar = Math.max(25, Math.ceil(views * 0.01));\n  return { id: r.id, platform: r.platform, views, replies, bar, pass: replies >= bar };\n});\nconst passed = results.filter(r => r.pass);\nreturn [{ json: {\n  total: results.length,\n  passed: passed.length,\n  any_pass: passed.length > 0,\n  detail: results,\n  offer: passed.length > 0 ? 'Circle $44 / Pro $53 / Team $62 — one Whop product each' : null,\n} }];"
        },
        "id": "f909da2a-db6e-58c7-94d4-29f00537894a",
        "name": "Demand gate",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
        "typeVersion": 2,
        "position": [
          440,
          0
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "conditions": {
            "options": {
              "caseSensitive": true,
              "leftValue": "",
              "typeValidation": "loose"
            },
            "conditions": [
              {
                "id": "p",
                "leftValue": "={{ $json.any_pass }}",
                "rightValue": "",
                "operator": {
                  "type": "boolean",
                  "operation": "true",
                  "singleValue": true
                }
              }
            ],
            "combinator": "and"
          },
          "options": {}
        },
        "id": "5fc21540-de61-5ca7-967a-f9f9e2d57eda",
        "name": "Any PASS?",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
        "typeVersion": 2,
        "position": [
          660,
          0
        ]
      },
