  {
    "name": "WF6 Chatfuel DM",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "### WF6 — Chatfuel DM reply\nChatfuel's comment automation fires this webhook with the inbound event:\n\n```json\n{ \"surface\": \"facebook\", \"conversation_id\": \"…\", \"text\": \"…\" }\n```\n\n1. **Normalise** — trim, lower-case the surface, refuse anything that is not\n   facebook, instagram or tiktok (YouTube has no DM channel in Chatfuel at all).\n2. **POST /api/chatfuel/dm** — the token stays in the app.\n3. **The link is built by the app** — `lib/whop-links.ts` turns a tier and a page into a\n   whop.com checkout or community link. This workflow never types a URL, and the app\n   refuses to send a DM carrying any other.\n4. **Wrong?** — Telegram. A DM that silently did not send is a member who asked a\n   question and never heard back.\n\nChatfuel answers **200 with `status: Failed` and a per-message `errors` array** for a\nDM it did not deliver, so the route refuses those (`CF04`, `CF05`) — this workflow\nonly has to read `ok`.\n\n**Requires:** `JARVIS_BRAIN_URL`, `CRON_SECRET`, `TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID`.",
          "height": 360,
          "width": 420,
          "color": 4
        },
        "id": "c22823ce-2ae6-544a-8f86-5865d48eb889",
        "name": "README",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          -380,
          0
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "httpMethod": "POST",
          "path": "chatfuel-dm",
          "responseMode": "lastNode",
          "options": {}
        },
        "id": "8ddd120f-aaf5-53ca-88e1-98282710acb9",
        "name": "Chatfuel fires",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
        "typeVersion": 2,
        "position": [
          0,
          0
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "jsCode": "const b = $json.body ?? $json;\nconst surface = String(b.surface || '').trim().toLowerCase();\nconst conversation_id = String(b.conversation_id || b.conversationId || '').trim();\nconst comment_id = String(b.comment_id || b.commentId || '').trim();\n// The comment's own timestamp, not now: the 7-day window is measured from it.\nconst inbound_at = String(b.inbound_at || b.timestamp || b.created_time || '').trim();\nconst tier = String(b.tier || 'free').trim().toLowerCase();\nconst page_ref = String(b.page_ref || b.page || 'unknown_page').trim();\nconst kind = b.kind === 'reply' ? 'reply' : 'private_reply';\nconst allowed = ['facebook','instagram','tiktok'];\nconst why = !allowed.includes(surface) ? `surface ${surface || '(none)'} has no Chatfuel DM`\n  : !conversation_id ? 'no conversation_id — a DM is a reply, not a broadcast'\n  : !inbound_at ? 'no inbound_at — the messaging window cannot be proven'\n  : kind === 'private_reply' && !comment_id ? 'no comment_id — one private reply per comment'\n  : null;\nreturn [{ json: { valid: why === null, why, surface, conversation_id, comment_id, inbound_at, tier, page_ref, kind } }];"
        },
        "id": "3ac15624-5e23-5d05-9d28-d6b89f43d1c2",
        "name": "Normalise",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          230,
          0
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "conditions": {
            "options": {
              "caseSensitive": true,
              "version": 2
            },
            "conditions": [
              {
                "leftValue": "={{ $json.valid }}",
                "rightValue": true,
                "operator": {
                  "type": "boolean",
                  "operation": "true",
                  "singleValue": true
                }
              }
            ],
            "combinator": "and"
          }
        },
        "id": "c5823235-c503-5c30-a556-84ec90210d89",
        "name": "Sendable?",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
        "typeVersion": 2.2,
        "position": [
          460,
          0
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "={{ $vars.JARVIS_BRAIN_URL }}/api/chatfuel/dm",
          "sendHeaders": true,
          "headerParameters": {
            "parameters": [
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": "=Bearer {{ $vars.CRON_SECRET }}"
              }
            ]
          },
          "sendBody": true,
          "specifyBody": "json",
          "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ surface: $json.surface, conversation_id: $json.conversation_id, kind: $json.kind, comment_id: $json.comment_id, inbound_at: $json.inbound_at, tier: $json.tier, page_ref: $json.page_ref }) }}",
          "options": {
            "timeout": 20000
          }
        },
        "id": "da4db81f-e0b1-5be5-904e-9b0bd05439cc",
        "name": "POST chatfuel/dm",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
        "typeVersion": 4.2,
        "position": [
          690,
          -80
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "conditions": {
            "options": {
              "caseSensitive": true,
              "version": 2
            },
            "conditions": [
              {
                "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}",
                "rightValue": true,
                "operator": {
                  "type": "boolean",
                  "operation": "true",
                  "singleValue": true
                }
              }
            ],
            "combinator": "and"
          }
        },
        "id": "592787f6-9d7a-5631-8d25-e277ba64e31b",
